---
The foot of the lighthouse, in a gale. Rain sideways. The whole town gathered with lanterns: the MAYOR, the CONSTABLE, the SAILORS, HETTIE, ROSALIND, MORDECAI. The beam sweeps over them.

MAYOR
Can anyone see them?

SAILOR 1
Not a thing.

SAILOR 2
The Dora’s in! The Dora’s in!

ALL
(a ragged cheer)
Hurrah!

ROSALIND
Two more. Keep the lanterns high. A boat steers by the beam, but it lands by the people.

HETTIE & ROSALIND
Light one for the boat that’s late—

MAYOR
(joining in, badly)
Light one for the gull—

A flare, far out. Everyone turns.

MORDECAI
There! By the Teeth!

SAILOR 1
That’s the Kittiwake. She’s clear. She’s clear of the rocks.

MAYOR
And Tobias? Where is Tobias?

Silence. The beam sweeps round, and round, and round.

MORDECAI
(very quietly)
Come on.

> SLOW FADE.
